    createStaticVNode('<h1 id="glossary" tabindex="-1">Glossary <a class="header-anchor" href="#glossary" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Glossary&quot;">​</a></h1><p>This page explains terms used in the documentation. Interface labels follow the apps. Configuration keys, technical identifiers and product names keep their original spelling.</p><h2 id="agent-and-devices" tabindex="-1">Agent and devices <a class="header-anchor" href="#agent-and-devices" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Agent and devices&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Term</th><th>Meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Agent<br>智能体</td><td>An AI program that uses tools to carry out tasks as well as reply.</td></tr><tr><td>Runtime<br>运行时</td><td>The program that runs the agent loop, tools and scheduled work.</td></tr><tr><td>Host / harness<br>宿主 / 执行框架</td><td>The application or framework that loads the agent and provides its execution environment.</td></tr><tr><td>Relay / nanoMuse Cloud<br>中继 / nanoMuse Cloud</td><td>The service for account sign-in, model forwarding and communication between the account&#39;s devices.</td></tr><tr><td>Hub<br>hub（设备互联）</td><td>The relay&#39;s connection through which devices of one account exchange requests and events.</td></tr><tr><td>Remote control<br>远程控制</td><td>Allowing another device of the account to request actions on this device.</td></tr><tr><td>Hands<br>「手」</td><td>The agent&#39;s ability to read a screen and click, type or swipe.</td></tr><tr><td>Operator<br>操作器</td><td>The loop that reads a screen, asks its model for an action and executes it.</td></tr><tr><td>Capsule<br>胶囊</td><td>The floating task display with the current step and Stop control.</td></tr><tr><td>Stage / glow / marker<br>舞台 / 光晕 / 标记</td><td>The operation display area, its visual boundary and the indication of an action&#39;s position.</td></tr><tr><td>Trajectory / trace<br>轨迹</td><td>A task&#39;s sequence of screens, actions and results.</td></tr><tr><td>Main chat / side chat<br>主要聊天 / 旁聊</td><td>The main ongoing conversation and additional separate task conversations.</td></tr><tr><td>Context / system prompt<br>上下文 / 系统提示词</td><td>The information supplied to the model, and the standing instructions included with it.</td></tr><tr><td>Feed / Ideas / Goals / Library<br>动态 / 点子 / 目标 / 资源库</td><td>The app&#39;s pages for posts, task suggestions, plans and generated files.</td></tr><tr><td>Routine / trigger / goal check<br>例程 / 触发器 / 目标检查</td><td>Work run at a scheduled time, work started by an event, and a scheduled review of a goal.</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="models-and-credentials" tabindex="-1">Models and credentials <a class="header-anchor" href="#models-and-credentials" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Models and credentials&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Term</th><th>Meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>LLM, large language model<br>大语言模型</td><td>A model that understands and generates language. The agent asks it for a reply or the next tool call; image support depends on the model.</td></tr><tr><td>Provider<br>服务商</td><td>The vendor or service supplying a model endpoint.</td></tr><tr><td>Endpoint / Base URL<br>端点 / 基础地址</td><td>An address receiving API requests, and the base address used to build those request URLs.</td></tr><tr><td>API key<br>API 密钥（key）</td><td>A credential used to authenticate requests to a service.</td></tr><tr><td>Access token<br>访问令牌</td><td>A credential issued after authentication or authorisation, sometimes with an expiry time.</td></tr><tr><td>Token usage<br>模型 token 用量</td><td>Units used by a model to represent input and output, not a direct character count.</td></tr><tr><td>Allowance<br>额度</td><td>The amount of model use available to an account.</td></tr><tr><td>Model slot / Automatic<br>模型用途设置 / 自动</td><td>A separate choice for chat, screen operation, images or video; Automatic resolves a source using the documented order.</td></tr><tr><td>Multimodal / vision<br>多模态 / 视觉能力</td><td>Support for multiple data types, such as text and images.</td></tr><tr><td>Embeddings / semantic recall<br>嵌入向量 / 语义检索</td><td>Numerical representations of text, used to retrieve memories by similarity of meaning.</td></tr><tr><td>OAuth / PKCE<br>OAuth / PKCE</td><td>An authorisation flow, with PKCE binding a returned authorisation code to the client that started it.</td></tr><tr><td>Vault<br>保险库</td><td>The encrypted store for credentials referenced as <code>{{vault:NAME}}</code>.</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="tools-and-connections" tabindex="-1">Tools and connections <a class="header-anchor" href="#tools-and-connections" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Tools and connections&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Term</th><th>Meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Tool call<br>工具调用</td><td>A structured request from the model for a program to perform an operation.</td></tr><tr><td>Skill<br>技能</td><td>A folder with a <code>SKILL.md</code> describing how to perform a class of tasks.</td></tr><tr><td>Connector<br>连接器</td><td>A configured connection that gives the agent access to a service&#39;s tools or data.</td></tr><tr><td>MCP server<br>MCP 服务器</td><td>A service exposing tools or data through the Model Context Protocol.</td></tr><tr><td>CLI / shell<br>命令行工具 / shell</td><td>A program controlled by text commands, and the command interpreter that runs them.</td></tr><tr><td>API / REST<br>程序接口 / REST</td><td>Interfaces for programs to exchange requests and data; REST commonly uses HTTP routes and methods.</td></tr><tr><td>JSON / TOML<br>JSON / TOML</td><td>JSON represents structured data exchanged by programs; TOML is a human-readable configuration format, as in <code>config.toml</code>.</td></tr><tr><td>stdio<br>标准输入输出</td><td>Communication with a local process through its input and output streams.</td></tr><tr><td>WebSocket / frame<br>WebSocket / 消息帧</td><td>A persistent two-way connection and an individual message sent over it.</td></tr><tr><td>SSE<br>服务器发送事件</td><td>An HTTP connection over which a server sends a stream of events to a client.</td></tr><tr><td>Webhook<br>事件回调</td><td>An HTTP address another program calls when an event occurs.</td></tr><tr><td>WebView / Playwright<br>内嵌网页组件 / 浏览器自动化工具</td><td>WebView displays web pages inside an app; Playwright controls a browser programmatically.</td></tr><tr><td>Accessibility tree / OCR<br>无障碍树 / 文字识别</td><td>Structured screen controls, and text recognised from an image.</td></tr><tr><td>GUI / grounding<br>图形界面 / 屏幕定位</td><td>The visible interface, and matching the intended element to the position to act on.</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="permissions-and-deployment" tabindex="-1">Permissions and deployment <a class="header-anchor" href="#permissions-and-deployment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Permissions and deployment&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Term</th><th>Meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Sentinel<br>哨兵（Sentinel）</td><td>The component that checks a tool call&#39;s risk and decides whether to allow, ask or deny.</td></tr><tr><td>Approval / grant scope<br>审批 / 授权范围</td><td>A user decision about an action, and the actions or time covered by a remembered decision.</td></tr><tr><td>Taint<br>污染标记</td><td>A record that a conversation has read private data, used when checking later outbound actions.</td></tr><tr><td>Sandbox / workspace<br>沙箱 / 工作区</td><td>An environment restricting a command&#39;s access, and the directory for the agent&#39;s working files.</td></tr><tr><td>Egress allowlist<br>外发白名单</td><td>The hosts allowed as outbound destinations under the configured policy.</td></tr><tr><td>ARM64 / x64<br>ARM64 / x64</td><td>Processor architectures. Choose a matching installer: ARM64 is common on phones and Apple Silicon computers; x64 on Intel and AMD computers.</td></tr><tr><td>Self-hosting / Docker<br>自行部署 / Docker</td><td>Running the service on your own server; Docker packages it and its environment in containers.</td></tr><tr><td>Loopback / LAN / reverse proxy<br>回环地址 / 局域网 / 反向代理</td><td>An address for the same computer, a local network, and a service forwarding incoming requests to an internal one.</td></tr><tr><td>TLS / HTTPS<br>连接加密 / HTTPS</td><td>TLS encrypts network traffic; HTTPS is HTTP protected by TLS.</td></tr><tr><td>CI / regression test<br>持续集成 / 回归测试</td><td>Automated project checks, and checks that existing behaviour still works after changes.</td></tr><tr><td>MockLLM / replay / live<br>模拟模型 / 回放 / 真实模型运行</td><td>Scripted responses, recorded responses used again, and new calls to the configured model.</td></tr><tr><td>P95 latency<br>P95 耗时</td><td>The duration at or below which 95% of the measured samples fall.</td></tr><tr><td>Idempotent / cursor / tombstone<br>幂等 / 游标 / 删除标记</td><td>Safe repeat processing, a position in an incremental feed, and a record of a deletion for sync.</td></tr></tbody></table>', 10)
